      <data key="d_tier">core</data>
      <data key="d_desc">einops.repeat expands a tensor by inserting/repeating dims, e.g. &quot;nrays p d -&gt; nrays nsegments p d&quot; with nsegments=NS, used to create pairs for batched ops.</data>
