      <data key="d_topic">Backprop</data>
      <data key="d_subtopic">Backprop</data>
      <data key="d_tier">core</data>
      <data key="d_desc">d/dx exp(x) = exp(x) = out, so exp_back returns out * grad_out — express the gradient using the already-computed forward output to avoid recomputing.</data>
