      <data key="d_topic">Backprop</data>
      <data key="d_subtopic">Backprop</data>
      <data key="d_tier">core</data>
      <data key="d_desc">d/dx log(x) = 1/x; for a scalar loss L the chain-rule local rule is dL/dx = dL/dout * (1/x).</data>
      <data key="d6"><y:ShapeNode>
        <y:Geometry height="42.0" width="164.0" x="0.0" y="0.0"/>
