    <node id="project-and-reshape-block">
      <data key="d_label">Reshape via Rearrange &#x27;b (c h w) -&gt; b c h w&#x27;</data>
      <data key="d_topic">VAEs and GANs</data>
      <data key="d_subtopic">VAEs and GANs</data>
      <data key="d_tier">core</data>
      <data key="d_desc">Generator&#x27;s first step maps the latent vector through a Linear layer to a (hidden_channels[0], first_h, first_h) feature map via Rearrange, then BN+ReLU.</data>
      <data key="d6"><y:ShapeNode>
