      <data key="d_topic">Optimization</data>
      <data key="d_subtopic">Optimization</data>
      <data key="d_tier">core</data>
      <data key="d_desc">Adam&#x27;s m_t ← β1 m + (1-β1) g is an exponentially weighted moving average (no terminal-velocity blowup); SGD-momentum b_t ← μ b + g accelerates to terminal velocity 1/(1-μ).</data>
